15.7.10:  Replacing OBC bulbs

-------------------------
I just replaced the OBC bulbs on my E30 on Sunday. Various views
on the easiest way to get at them have been posted. I tried both the glove
compartment and the center console methods. The glove compartment might
be OK if you have hands the size of a 5 year old. The center consoleway
is pretty good, only pain in the butt is getting the lower screws back in.
I think you only need to get the right hand one out.
I played around with a few bulb types as RS in all their wonderfulness,
had a crap selection. Turns out the ones that work great are the 6V 100 mA
